[PrintTextModified Text:回到地下后，<br>艾玛发觉了一件事。|#0101Adv06_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:那就是，所有人的牢房前面<br>多了一块写着囚犯编号的板子。|#0101Adv06_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:（我的囚犯编号是658号……）|#0101Adv06_Ema001| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她站在今早醒来的牢房前，确认好现场情况后正准备回房。|#0101Adv06_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

@ResetText
@ModifyBackgroundExtended DissolveTexturePath:VerticalBlindGradually TintColor:#000000 Duration:0.9 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor.Custom SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:1.5

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:1_1
@ModifyBackgroundExtended DissolveTexturePath:VerticalBlindGradually Duration:0.9 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent.Custom SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:0.9

[PrintTextModified Text:这时，手机恰好震动了起来，<br>响起了猫头鹰叫声的提示音。|#0101Adv06_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ========================================
; [sfx 14：フクロウの通知音]
; ========================================

@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_14 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:她赶紧拿出手机，<br>看到上面显示的是典狱长发来的通知。|#0101Adv06_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她打开手机里的聊天APP后，<br>弹出一条典狱长（头像是它自己的抽象画）<br>传来的信息。|#0101Adv06_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"『放风时间结束了。<br>　请大家迅速返回自己的牢房内』|#0101Adv06_Narrative007|" RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"『不遵守规定的人，<br>　会被扭送至惩罚室……』|#0101Adv06_Narrative008|" RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:『请大家不要给我增加工作……』|#0101Adv06_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:看来典狱长的通知<br>也会直接推到手机里。|#0101Adv06_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛才刚坐在床上没多久，<br>便传来了昭示时限到来的上锁声。|#0101Adv06_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ========================================
; [sfx 4：牢の施錠音]
; ========================================

@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_4 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:"（明明是个老旧的建筑物，<br>　安装的却是自动锁……总感觉有点错位）|#0101Adv06_Ema002|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:看样子，每间牢房都是双人间。<br>她刚刚有看到，其他少女进了同一间牢房。|#0101Adv06_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:1.8 Lazy:false ScenePosition:10,30 AppearanceAndTransition:1_1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:而艾玛却是孤身一人。<br>因为同在一间房醒来的希罗被杀了。|#0101Adv06_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:希罗……|#0101Adv06_Ema003| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@SpawnBlur ActorId:MainBackground-Middle FadeDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:虽然紧闭双唇，<br>但泪珠却一颗颗从眼中流下。|#0101Adv06_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideActors ActorIds:MainBackground-Middle Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛想止住伤感，马上用袖子擦去了眼泪。<br>紧接着，她开始观察起室内。|#0101Adv06_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（之前因为恐慌，还没好好观察室内……<br>　这里有洗脸台和厕所，还有桌椅也都有）|#0101Adv06_Ema004|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（至少有最低限度的生活保障……<br>　我们要一直在这个地方生活下去吗……？）|#0101Adv06_Ema005|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（对了，确认一下规定吧）|#0101Adv06_Ema006| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她拿出口袋里的手机，<br>查看上面的内容。|#0101Adv06_Narrative016| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（虽然不是自己的手机，<br>　不过功能和我熟悉的型号一样）|#0101Adv06_Ema007|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:身处昏暗不见天日的地下，容易失去对时间的判断。<br>看手机上的时钟显示，<br>现在是15时刚过一点点的时间。|#0101Adv06_Narrative017| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（能确认时间已经很好了。<br>　要是能用它联络外部就好了……）|#0101Adv06_Ema008|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:和蕾雅刚才说的一样，<br>手机里面安装了一个叫【魔女图鉴】的APP。|#0101Adv06_Narrative018| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛启动了APP，确认里面的内容。|#0101Adv06_Narrative019| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:根据监牢规定，<br>除了放风时间以外，<br>囚犯必须留在指定的牢房内。|#0101Adv06_Narrative020| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:外面会有看守时常巡逻，<br>如果发现了囚犯，会将其送到惩罚室关上两天。|#0101Adv06_Narrative021| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:此外，如果作出违反规定的行为，<br>也是会送到惩罚室里面。|#0101Adv06_Narrative022| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（惩罚室……究竟是个什么样的地方呢）|#0101Adv06_Ema009| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛脸色发青，但还是小小叹了口气。|#0101Adv06_Narrative023| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:典狱长之前说过的话，<br>在关于魔女审判的规定上也有讲。|#0101Adv06_Narrative024| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"『囚犯受到强烈精神压力后，<br>　魔女因子会得到增强，魔女化程度便会加深』|#0101Adv06_Narrative025|" RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"『成为魔女之人，有可能会因为难以忍受的<br>　杀人冲动，犯下杀人的罪行』|#0101Adv06_Narrative026|" RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"『如果发生了凶杀案，<br>　为了将危险的魔女处死，将开展魔女审判』|#0101Adv06_Narrative027|" RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"『囚犯们应经过讨论、投票，选出魔女，<br>　之后魔女将当场处死』|#0101Adv06_Narrative028|" RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:怎么可能会发生凶杀案……|#0101Adv06_Ema010| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（虽然希罗失控了……<br>　可是其他人看起来都是同龄的普通人）|#0101Adv06_Ema011|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（根本无法想像<br>　她们会互相厮杀……）|#0101Adv06_Ema012|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛摇了摇头，不再多想，<br>重新集中精神看魔女图鉴的内容。|#0101Adv06_Narrative029| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"『完全成为魔女之人，<br>　可获得强韧肉体，不会轻易死亡』|#0101Adv06_Narrative030|" RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"『完全成为魔女之人，<br>　持有的【魔法】会得到爆发式增强』|#0101Adv06_Narrative031|" RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"『但，其终将失去人形，<br>　成为完全的【残骸】』|#0101Adv06_Narrative032|" RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:魔法……？可是我不会用欸……|#0101Adv06_Ema013| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛有些不解。|#0101Adv06_Narrative033| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:累了……|#0101Adv06_Ema014| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_179 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0
@SpawnBlur ActorId:MainBackground-Middle Intensity:0 FadeDuration:0
@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:1.8 Lazy:false ScenePosition:10,70 AppearanceAndTransition:1_1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:她放弃了进一步思考，把手机扔到了一边，<br>躺平在硬硬的床铺上。|#0101Adv06_Narrative034| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（软绵绵的被窝……最爱的抱枕……<br>　高中的制服……一切都不复存在了）|#0101Adv06_Ema015|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:爸爸妈妈，你们有没有在担心我……？|#0101Adv06_Ema016| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（他们肯定有找警察报案，<br>　现在还在拼命地找我……）|#0101Adv06_Ema017|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

