[PrintTextModified Text:呜……|#0101Adv06_Ema018| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（虽然初中搞砸了，<br>　但是我明明已经下了决心）|#0101Adv06_Ema019|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（要在高中交很多朋友，<br>　不要再让爸妈操心的……）|#0101Adv06_Ema020|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（为什么我要被关进<br>　这种地方里面……？）|#0101Adv06_Ema021|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

